  "jurisdiction": "Medicare Administrative Contractor (MAC) LCD",
  "effective_date": "2023-01-01",
  "category": "Orthopedic Surgery",
  "description": "Medicare coverage criteria for matrix-induced autologous chondrocyte implantation (MACI) of the femoral condyle or trochlea. Requires full-thickness focal chondral defect (Outerbridge Grade IV, size 1.5 to 10 cm2), failure of prior conservative or surgical microfracture, and absence of diffuse osteoarthritis.",
